From 79f0fe004d21b1960595adce163793a83c26d8b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Heidelberg <david@ixit.cz>
Date: Sat, 14 Feb 2026 16:40:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 114/211] Input: support for STM FTS5

Used on various phones. Minimal viable driver.

Includes device-tree enabling touchscreen on Pixel 3.
Also, tested on Xiaomi Mi 8 (device-tree is not yet inside the mainline).

What is missing:
 - switching between AP and SLPI mode (to be able to wake up phone by touch)
 - firmware loading
 - anything above basic touch

